  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *soportado*",
    "*No soporto el ruido* — I can't stand the noise (very common usage)",
    "Often used in negative: *no soportar* = can't stand / can't bear",
    "Also means to support/hold up structurally: *Las columnas soportan el techo* — The columns support the roof",
    "False friend: NOT the same as English \"to support\" in emotional sense — use *apoyar* for emotional support"
